2 Nabiji mobile app is designed to save your time, energy and money.

In the application, you will find the latest offers, promotions, discounts and use loyalty cards.

You can add both an electronic card and an existing plastic card to the application, in addition you can unite family members’ cards into one account, collect points together, save faster and easier.

If you are our customer, install the application, register simply and get special offers created for you. 

With 2 Nabiji mobile application you can:

•	Receive information on special offers, news and promotions;
•	View check, transaction history and analytics;
•	Receive information about accumulated points and savings;
•	Easily find nearby and desired 2 Nabiji store addresses on the map;
•	Browse through the discount catalog and exchange points for the desired discount;
